# helper_apk.uaw — helper-APK on-demand acceptance (UI part).
#
# Precondition (runner): target build installed + grants set + app at chat
# (onboarding passed). Starts at chat, ends at the a11y installer.
# File asserts (size+sha) are the runner's job after this scenario.
#
# Element inventory (uaw_elements, 20261011_015941Z):
#   drawer hamburger: icon only, no text -> TAP_AT 49 110
#   wizard buttons: "Install Bundled Version" (shizuku), "Install Provider App" (a11y)

EXPECT 15 New Chat
TAP_AT 49 110
TAP Permissions
EXPECT 20 Permission Level
TAP DEBUGGER
EXPECT 20 Debug Permission
SWIPE_UP
EXPECT 20 Install Bundled Version
TAP Install Bundled Version
EXPECT 90 want to install
BACK
TAP ACCESSIBILITY
EXPECT 20 Permission Level
SWIPE_UP
EXPECT 20 Install Provider App
TAP Install Provider App
EXPECT 20 Confirm
TYPE I%sunderstand%sand%sacknowledge%sthe%srisks%sof%saccount%sbans%sand%srestricted%saccount%sfunctions%scaused%sby%saccessibility%spermissions,%sand%sI%sbear%sthe%sconsequences%smyself
HIDEKB
TAP Confirm
EXPECT 90 want to install
BACK
